	(text "JTAG level shift 3.3 V -> 1.8 V. The buffers are disabled while the\nChipWhisperer drives JTAG (CW_JTAG_SEL_N low). Channel A is wired as on the\nAMD VCK190 (XTP610): Vivado uses it after program_ftdi."
